WEBVTT

00:12.012 --> 00:14.389
Kick the murderer out!

00:14.472 --> 00:15.890
Kick him out!

00:15.974 --> 00:18.476
What did our kids do to deserve this?

00:18.560 --> 00:20.270
What did our kids do?

00:20.353 --> 00:22.272
Isolate the murderer!

00:22.355 --> 00:24.733
Isolate him!

00:24.816 --> 00:26.109
It's Cho Gyu-cheol!

00:26.192 --> 00:28.862
-Bastard! How dare you come here!
-Cho Gyu-cheol!

00:28.945 --> 00:30.488
-Look over here!
-You're not human!

00:30.572 --> 00:31.656
Drop out, you bastard!

00:32.240 --> 00:34.659
-How dare you go in!
-This is outrageous!

00:34.743 --> 00:36.536
Kick him out, for God's sake!

00:36.619 --> 00:40.707
You expect our kids to go to school
with him? Kick him out!

00:42.042 --> 00:44.586
Cho Gyu-cheol has shown
deep remorse for his crimes,

00:44.669 --> 00:49.174
followed the correctional facility rules,
and set an example for others.

00:49.799 --> 00:52.177
Given his minor status and clean record,

00:52.260 --> 00:57.182
the committee finds no risk of recidivism
and hereby grants parole.

01:24.209 --> 01:25.668
What do you think, sir?

01:26.628 --> 01:28.505
I'm talking about Cho Gyu-cheol.

01:33.009 --> 01:36.513
He was paroled
as soon as he completed his minimum term.

01:36.596 --> 01:38.890
When the Educational Rights Committee
signed off,

01:38.973 --> 01:41.893
they approved his readmission
almost instantly.

01:41.976 --> 01:44.854
Everything lining up perfectly,
as if planned, feels off.

01:44.938 --> 01:47.690
It's worth looking into, isn't it?

01:48.191 --> 01:50.318
Readmission
is at the principal's discretion.

01:51.277 --> 01:53.238
Cho Gyu-cheol has already been punished,

01:53.321 --> 01:57.784
and the ERPB has no authority to deny
a student the chance to return to school.

02:00.203 --> 02:01.746
If I stopped him…

02:05.083 --> 02:06.501
that would be revenge.

02:10.547 --> 02:11.506
Where's Inspector Na?

02:11.589 --> 02:14.175
He had to stop by somewhere
before coming in.

02:16.886 --> 02:17.887
Where?

03:03.516 --> 03:07.645
TEACH YOU A LESSON

03:08.438 --> 03:10.440
You look good in your uniform, don't you?

03:12.609 --> 03:14.110
Don't be nervous.

03:14.194 --> 03:16.362
I'm here as an ERPB inspector today.

03:17.322 --> 03:18.823
You're a test case

03:19.324 --> 03:21.910
to see if kids like you
can handle school again,

03:21.993 --> 03:23.953
if rehabilitation is possible,

03:24.037 --> 03:25.496
and if you deserve

03:26.372 --> 03:28.875
another chance.

03:31.294 --> 03:32.253
I will

03:33.296 --> 03:34.464
really do my best.

03:34.547 --> 03:37.008
No, just don't do anything.

03:37.091 --> 03:39.135
Just breathe and live quietly.

03:39.636 --> 03:40.762
Live a normal life.

03:42.931 --> 03:44.432
Live like a student.

03:50.939 --> 03:52.774
I'm sure you know what I mean.

04:14.963 --> 04:16.839
This is Cho Gyu-cheol,
back in school today.

04:16.923 --> 04:19.384
He's older than you, so be nice.

04:20.301 --> 04:22.262
-Say hi.
-Okay.

04:23.554 --> 04:26.474
I'll make sure
I don't get in the way of your studies.

04:28.142 --> 04:29.394
Nice to meet you.

04:37.110 --> 04:37.944
What?

04:38.027 --> 04:40.071
-Jong-su.
-What, dumbass?

04:41.406 --> 04:42.865
How could you… to a teacher…

04:44.492 --> 04:46.661
Seong-gu, call 119, for fuck's sake!

04:46.744 --> 04:48.329
Hey, stab him again.

04:48.871 --> 04:50.248
Damn, you're no fun.

04:50.331 --> 04:51.708
Hey.

04:52.625 --> 04:54.585
I heard you killed someone.

04:54.669 --> 04:56.087
A teacher, no less.

04:57.964 --> 05:00.925
Wow, fucking hell.
Check out the look in his eyes.

05:02.218 --> 05:03.428
You gonna kill me too?

05:09.225 --> 05:11.602
A goddamn murderer, studying?

05:15.565 --> 05:19.068
You feel this is unfair?
You want me to speak politely to you?

05:20.153 --> 05:22.363
No, it's fine. Speak however you want.

05:23.865 --> 05:25.366
Damn, you're chill.

05:25.450 --> 05:26.367
Behave yourself.

05:26.451 --> 05:30.121
If you act up and the ERPB shows up,
you'll be in trouble too.

05:31.122 --> 05:32.040
Get it?

05:33.541 --> 05:35.960
Yeah, I will. Thanks for the advice.

05:36.544 --> 05:38.171
What the hell? Let's go.

05:38.755 --> 05:39.881
Cigs.

05:39.964 --> 05:41.341
Cigs.

05:41.924 --> 05:43.551
-What a loser.
-Hey, are you coming?

05:43.634 --> 05:44.761
Yeah, coming.

06:07.283 --> 06:14.290
RESTRICTED AREA
AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

06:30.056 --> 06:31.933
It's hilarious seeing him act all shy.

06:32.016 --> 06:33.559
Hey, show me the picture.

06:33.643 --> 06:34.644
Shit, I got a text.

06:35.144 --> 06:35.978
Here, look.

06:41.692 --> 06:42.777
That looks good too.

06:43.277 --> 06:44.779
-Holy shit, hold on.
-Why?

06:45.446 --> 06:46.406
I got an S-class.

06:46.906 --> 06:48.574
Screw you.

06:48.658 --> 06:50.576
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

06:50.660 --> 06:52.537
Oh man, this is insane.

06:52.620 --> 06:53.704
What's the matter?

06:53.788 --> 06:56.040
It's a report about a student
assaulting a teacher

06:56.124 --> 06:58.334
after being told not to use their phone.

06:58.418 --> 07:00.711
He challenged the teacher
under Yatcha rules.

07:00.795 --> 07:02.505
Yatcha rules? What's that?

07:03.339 --> 07:06.509
It's a bare-knuckle fight.
No rank, no rules.

07:06.592 --> 07:08.386
We're doing everything we can,

07:08.469 --> 07:10.471
yet things like this keep happening.

07:12.849 --> 07:14.517
What are you doing out there? Come in.

07:15.017 --> 07:17.061
Someone is here to see you.

07:17.145 --> 07:18.020
Bring them in.

07:18.938 --> 07:19.772
Okay.

07:47.842 --> 07:48.801
Right.

07:50.470 --> 07:52.680
What brings you here?

07:53.806 --> 07:55.141
I have something to tell you.

07:56.058 --> 07:57.977
You've got some nerve coming here!

07:58.478 --> 08:00.646
This is the ERPB.

08:00.730 --> 08:03.691
Any student can come here.

08:04.275 --> 08:05.276
Have a seat.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.496
So what brings you here?

08:17.455 --> 08:19.499
I'm here to report bullying at school.

08:21.584 --> 08:24.045
Ms. Choi once told me

08:24.545 --> 08:26.714
that looking out
for others who are struggling

08:26.797 --> 08:28.758
is something students should also learn.

08:28.841 --> 08:30.885
How dare you say her name!

08:30.968 --> 08:32.094
Inspector Im Han-rim.

08:32.178 --> 08:34.055
Aren't any of you angry?

08:34.555 --> 08:35.973
Inspector Im Han-rim.

08:36.057 --> 08:38.059
Go outside and get some air.

08:38.559 --> 08:39.393
Okay?

08:40.853 --> 08:42.188
Come on, let's go.

08:45.691 --> 08:46.526
All right.

08:51.364 --> 08:52.865
Finish what you were saying.

08:54.033 --> 08:56.953
I'm sorry for bringing up Ms. Choi's name.

09:06.254 --> 09:08.506
This is the kid getting bullied.

09:14.095 --> 09:16.681
He's definitely up to something.

09:17.181 --> 09:20.851
But the information he gave us
was pretty specific.

09:21.644 --> 09:22.478
He's right.

09:22.562 --> 09:25.523
Cho Gyu-cheol isn't an exception.
We'll do as we always have.

09:26.107 --> 09:28.776
Deputy Director Bong Geun-dae,
this case is yours.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.696
-Yes, sir.
-No, I'll go.

09:32.572 --> 09:34.574
You can't, sir. Instead, I will--

09:34.657 --> 09:36.993
Is there a reason why I can't go?

09:39.495 --> 09:40.496
Stop him, won't you?

09:41.330 --> 09:42.415
Should I stop you?

09:43.457 --> 09:45.126
Stop the traffic instead.

09:46.711 --> 09:48.087
-Oh dear.
-I'm sorry.

09:49.880 --> 09:53.509
Don't even think about
telling any jokes, anywhere.

09:55.052 --> 09:56.012
Get going.

09:56.095 --> 09:56.929
Okay.

09:57.013 --> 10:00.391
-You shouldn't laugh at his jokes.
-I'll see you later.

10:00.891 --> 10:01.809
Deputy Bong.

10:02.310 --> 10:03.603
Oh, come on. Not now.

10:04.270 --> 10:06.897
Don't try to stop me. I'm not traffic.

10:07.857 --> 10:09.275
I laughed. I'm so annoyed.

10:09.358 --> 10:10.610
What's wrong with…

10:10.693 --> 10:12.320
-I'm sorry, Minister.
-Don't laugh.

10:12.403 --> 10:13.696
You shouldn't laugh.

10:14.196 --> 10:15.197
Oh man, I laughed.

10:24.415 --> 10:25.708
JINWON HIGH SCHOOL

10:25.791 --> 10:27.209
Jang Seong-gu from my class?

10:28.210 --> 10:30.254
Seong-gu is being bullied?

10:33.007 --> 10:35.635
He didn't seem to have any problems
from the outside.

10:36.218 --> 10:37.511
He has a lot of friends,

10:37.595 --> 10:42.016
and Seong-gu himself said
he was enjoying school.

10:42.642 --> 10:44.435
We'll sing "Emergency Room" at karaoke.

10:44.518 --> 10:46.187
-No.
-What?

10:47.563 --> 10:49.315
Stop stuffing your face with my chips.

10:49.398 --> 10:50.441
Okay.

10:52.568 --> 10:53.653
That's lit.

10:54.278 --> 10:56.572
-What the…
-Hey, what's going on?

10:57.239 --> 10:58.449
Why is it lagging?

11:01.118 --> 11:02.411
Where did Jang Seong-gu go?

11:06.791 --> 11:09.502
Why are you nervous? Did I scare you?

11:10.002 --> 11:11.003
Well…

11:11.671 --> 11:13.047
You're from the ERPB.

11:13.130 --> 11:14.298
Yeah.

11:14.799 --> 11:15.966
Do you know why I'm here?

11:16.050 --> 11:17.802
No, I don't.

11:17.885 --> 11:20.346
We were tipped off
that someone was being bullied.

11:21.347 --> 11:22.890
That doesn't happen here.

11:23.974 --> 11:24.850
Excuse me.

11:27.311 --> 11:28.145
Let's see.

11:30.314 --> 11:31.774
-Say, "Ah."
-What?

11:31.857 --> 11:32.942
Come on, say, "Ah."

11:36.862 --> 11:38.322
At least you weren't hit.

11:38.406 --> 11:40.700
Oh man, it's not me.

11:41.283 --> 11:42.743
I'll be on my way.

11:43.327 --> 11:44.704
Are you Wi-Fi?

11:47.540 --> 11:51.419
Do you turn your hotspot on so the kids
can use their phones and play games?

11:52.336 --> 11:53.629
Are you a human Wi-Fi?

11:56.424 --> 11:59.635
You're always at the center,
like people gathering around Wi-Fi.

11:59.719 --> 12:02.763
And you're always the first one
to take out your phone.

12:02.847 --> 12:04.682
You probably do that

12:04.765 --> 12:07.893
to turn your hotspot on
so they can connect to Wi-Fi.

12:09.270 --> 12:12.732
Also, you're the only one
carrying around that huge power bank.

12:13.232 --> 12:15.317
You can't let the Wi-Fi go down, can you?

12:22.032 --> 12:23.909
I'm really not a human Wi-Fi.

12:24.452 --> 12:26.704
But seriously, I really have to go.

12:26.787 --> 12:28.622
I'll be going now. Yeah.

12:30.082 --> 12:31.375
Hey, the punk's here.

12:31.459 --> 12:33.919
Hey, Jang Seong-gu.
What are you doing here?

12:34.003 --> 12:35.254
Well, a moment ago…

12:35.337 --> 12:37.840
I was just walking, and the ERPB…

12:37.923 --> 12:40.384
Holy fuck. It's the ERPB.

12:40.468 --> 12:42.011
Watch your language.

12:42.094 --> 12:44.180
What's the ERPB doing at our school?

12:44.930 --> 12:46.307
Fuck, I know.

12:46.390 --> 12:47.600
Is it Cho Gyu-cheol?

12:47.683 --> 12:49.268
No, I'm here because of you.

12:49.351 --> 12:50.853
I heard you're a bully.

12:51.479 --> 12:53.355
-Me?
-Yeah.

12:55.107 --> 12:56.650
Who did I bully?

12:56.734 --> 12:59.612
I told you no!

12:59.695 --> 13:03.115
Please don't accuse innocent people.
It's really not like that!

13:03.199 --> 13:05.993
Why are you upsetting our sweet Seong-gu?

13:06.076 --> 13:08.037
Seong-gu, that's enough, man.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.080
The ERPB can make mistakes too.

13:11.916 --> 13:12.958
Can we go now?

13:13.667 --> 13:14.668
Sure.

13:14.752 --> 13:16.879
-Okay. Goodbye, sir.
-Yeah.

13:17.505 --> 13:18.339
Let's go.

13:19.173 --> 13:22.343
Hey, you scared me there.
I thought you'd vanished.

13:22.426 --> 13:23.886
Were you here all along?

13:24.386 --> 13:26.096
Why are you all sweaty, Seong-gu?

13:28.891 --> 13:30.309
Hey, squad up.

13:30.392 --> 13:31.560
I got a legendary item.

13:33.354 --> 13:34.438
Don't engage now.

13:34.522 --> 13:35.439
-Stay back.
-Okay.

13:36.565 --> 13:37.566
Bong Geun-dae?

13:39.401 --> 13:41.570
Hey, you're Geun-dae, right?
Bong Geun-dae.

13:41.654 --> 13:44.532
-Yeah. Yes.
-It's been ages. How are you?

13:44.615 --> 13:47.159
Yeah, I'm good. What about you?

13:47.243 --> 13:50.788
I heard you're a civil servant.
I think I heard where you worked.

13:51.288 --> 13:52.248
The ERPB? Right?

13:52.331 --> 13:53.457
-The ERPB.
-Wait.

13:53.541 --> 13:54.667
-Hold on.
-Good for you.

13:54.750 --> 13:56.752
I'll call you later.

13:56.836 --> 13:57.795
Sorry.

13:57.878 --> 13:59.380
Wait, Bong Geun-dae.

13:59.463 --> 14:01.882
-One of you, get in here.
-Hold on.

14:01.966 --> 14:03.717
-Hey, we should go.
-Yeah, after this.

14:03.801 --> 14:04.927
-A bit more.
-Group up.

14:05.010 --> 14:06.011
Yeah, okay.

14:13.394 --> 14:14.687
That was fast. Got the audio?

14:14.770 --> 14:16.772
-Wait a minute.
-Why?

14:17.398 --> 14:19.316
-I messed up.
-What?

14:19.400 --> 14:20.359
Put these on.

14:20.442 --> 14:21.777
-Here.
-Why should I?

14:22.820 --> 14:24.363
-What are you doing?
-Hold on.

14:24.446 --> 14:25.406
I failed. Stay still.

14:26.574 --> 14:28.033
Put this in your right ear.

14:28.117 --> 14:29.994
-Isn't this that thing?
-An earpiece.

14:30.077 --> 14:31.620
-Isn't this eyeshadow?
-Yeah.

14:31.704 --> 14:33.497
-What are you…
-Hold still.

14:35.666 --> 14:36.667
It's done.

14:37.167 --> 14:38.377
Just remember one thing.

14:38.460 --> 14:41.338
A loser never makes eye contact.

14:41.964 --> 14:42.923
A loser?

14:46.093 --> 14:47.970
Fucking hell. What?

14:48.053 --> 14:50.347
Let's just go, idiot. Something feels off.

14:50.431 --> 14:53.976
-What the hell, dumbass?
-You're a fucking noob anyway. Let's go.

14:54.476 --> 14:55.311
I said let's go.

15:00.774 --> 15:02.026
Fuck, what are you doing?

15:03.235 --> 15:04.653
Are you freaking blind or what?

15:05.279 --> 15:06.405
Look down.

15:09.450 --> 15:10.993
You're fucking lucky.

15:11.076 --> 15:12.328
Don't let me see you again.

15:12.411 --> 15:14.496
Quit acting dumb and fuck off, damn it.

15:18.292 --> 15:19.793
It's because you flipped out.

15:19.877 --> 15:22.171
Inspector Im Han-rim,
good job holding back.

15:22.254 --> 15:24.465
Damn it, that fucking bastard.

15:27.760 --> 15:29.887
Is it done? Testing.

15:31.847 --> 15:34.016
I'm done cloning Lee Chi-ho's voice.

15:34.099 --> 15:35.351
-Let's check it out.
-Okay.

15:37.269 --> 15:38.771
-It's Chi-ho.
-It's Chi-ho.

15:38.854 --> 15:40.981
-What's the password?
-What's the password?

15:41.065 --> 15:42.232
Nice.

15:42.316 --> 15:43.859
Wow.

15:46.028 --> 15:49.114
-Okay, then. I'll call Jang Seong-gu now.
-I'm a bit nervous.

15:49.198 --> 15:51.325
Don't be nervous. Just act natural.

15:53.953 --> 15:55.079
Hello?

15:56.121 --> 15:57.164
It's me, Chi-ho.

15:57.247 --> 16:00.209
I'd appreciate it
if you could give me the password.

16:00.876 --> 16:02.169
Is this really Chi-ho?

16:02.252 --> 16:04.463
You don't sound like yourself.

16:04.546 --> 16:05.756
-Who is this?
-Let me.

16:09.468 --> 16:12.346
You fucking asshole, who else would I be?
Goddamn idiot.

16:12.429 --> 16:13.555
Give me the password.

16:13.639 --> 16:16.558
It's Wi-Fi. "Wi-Fi" in Korean.

16:25.317 --> 16:28.529
The account belongs to Seong-gu,
but he doesn't have his own profile.

16:28.612 --> 16:31.657
They've been sharing the same account.

16:31.740 --> 16:33.951
I checked Seong-gu's food delivery app,

16:34.034 --> 16:36.286
and he's had deliveries
to several addresses.

16:36.370 --> 16:38.455
There were even orders over 100,000 won.

16:38.539 --> 16:40.833
He's subscribed to more than 20 games.

16:40.916 --> 16:43.502
That's impossible
unless all he does is play games.

16:43.585 --> 16:45.838
He had a lot of charges
for e-scooter rentals too.

16:46.505 --> 16:47.923
It says he's on one right now.

16:48.007 --> 16:50.884
It says the food just got delivered.

16:51.719 --> 16:53.846
He just logged into a game too.

16:53.929 --> 16:56.598
Are you saying
Jang Seong-gu is on a scooter,

16:56.682 --> 17:00.060
eating with one hand
and playing a game with the other?

17:12.197 --> 17:14.992
Do you really need to picture it?
It's obviously impossible.

17:15.075 --> 17:16.952
Money isn't the real problem, is it?

17:17.036 --> 17:19.204
What about the scam cases you looked into?

17:20.622 --> 17:24.501
There's a website
where scam victims share information.

17:24.585 --> 17:26.045
I looked up Seong-gu's user ID,

17:26.128 --> 17:29.506
and it showed reports of undelivered items
and fake sales on resale apps.

17:29.590 --> 17:31.008
They were all scam-related.

17:31.091 --> 17:33.218
The punks used Seong-gu's ID
to post fake items,

17:33.302 --> 17:35.763
then took the money
and ghosted the buyers.

17:35.846 --> 17:39.141
Isn't this way too much
for just one kid to deal with on his own?

17:54.990 --> 17:55.991
The goddamn scammer.

17:57.201 --> 17:59.411
You scammed me over the AirPods,
didn't you?

17:59.495 --> 18:02.081
No, it wasn't me. I really didn't do it.

18:02.164 --> 18:03.957
Some kids stole my account.

18:04.041 --> 18:06.293
-Really, I didn't--
-You son of a bitch.

18:06.794 --> 18:08.378
It really wasn't me.

18:08.462 --> 18:12.966
You fucking asshole, you asked for it.
You bastard.

18:13.050 --> 18:14.384
You goddamn bastard.

18:14.468 --> 18:16.929
You little shit, trying to pull scams?
You wanna die?

18:17.012 --> 18:19.807
You goddamn thief.
Give me my money back, you bastard.

18:21.725 --> 18:22.601
Damn.

18:24.937 --> 18:27.564
You idiot. Why'd you get caught?

18:33.570 --> 18:36.323
He said I'll be sorry
if I don't pay him back.

18:36.990 --> 18:37.825
And?

18:37.908 --> 18:41.203
Chi-ho, I'm really sorry,
but I don't have any money.

18:41.286 --> 18:43.747
-If you could help out a bit--
-That's too bad.

18:44.248 --> 18:46.125
I've run out of allowance too.

18:46.625 --> 18:48.710
You take care of it, okay?

18:49.294 --> 18:50.170
Chi-ho.

18:51.463 --> 18:52.506
Please, I'm asking you.

18:52.589 --> 18:54.091
For God's sake.

18:55.926 --> 18:58.178
I said I'd deal with it later.

18:58.262 --> 18:59.763
Yeah, but when?

19:01.807 --> 19:03.016
Should I break my promise?

19:05.227 --> 19:07.437
No, keep your promise.

19:07.521 --> 19:10.649
Do you know what would happen
if I changed my mind?

19:10.732 --> 19:13.735
Everything is under your account
and your name, okay?

19:13.819 --> 19:15.320
You'll be the one who's fucked.

19:15.404 --> 19:17.781
But I told you
I'd deal with everything later.

19:19.283 --> 19:20.284
Super grateful, right?

19:23.620 --> 19:25.414
My son tells me

19:25.497 --> 19:30.210
your son uses my son's account
to order food and spend money on games.

19:31.879 --> 19:34.840
Take a look.
Hundreds of thousands of won were charged.

19:35.674 --> 19:38.260
That's your side of the story.

19:38.343 --> 19:41.388
I told Chi-ho to come home now,
so let's hear his side too.

19:44.600 --> 19:45.767
There you are.

19:46.268 --> 19:47.311
Hey, Jang Seong-gu.

19:47.811 --> 19:49.438
Go. It's okay.

19:50.689 --> 19:52.191
You sent this crap to my sister?

19:56.612 --> 19:57.863
You DMed her.

19:57.946 --> 19:59.907
Oh my God, what is this?

19:59.990 --> 20:03.243
Seong-gu, did you really send her this?

20:03.327 --> 20:05.037
Mom, I didn't do this.

20:05.120 --> 20:07.748
-It's Chi-ho. He did this too.
-Excuse me?

20:07.831 --> 20:10.542
Are you saying Chi-ho sent this
to his own sister?

20:10.626 --> 20:12.002
Does that make any sense?

20:12.085 --> 20:13.045
Are you crazy?

20:13.712 --> 20:16.381
-I should call the police. Unbelievable.
-Mom.

20:16.465 --> 20:17.674
No, wait.

20:18.175 --> 20:19.301
I'm sorry.

20:19.384 --> 20:22.554
If this offended you,
I apologize on his behalf.

20:22.638 --> 20:24.139
Please forgive him this once.

20:24.223 --> 20:26.308
-Next time…
-This will never happen again.

20:26.391 --> 20:29.353
…I'll send it to every girl in our class
using your account.

20:29.436 --> 20:31.730
-Snitch on me again, dumbass.
-They're only kids.

20:33.690 --> 20:36.777
-Ji-ho, you okay?
-Please forget why I came. I'm so…

20:36.860 --> 20:38.570
Hey, I'm so sorry. All right?

20:39.655 --> 20:40.656
-Go.
-Are you insane?

20:40.739 --> 20:42.074
Mom, it wasn't me.

20:42.157 --> 20:43.450
Be quiet, you fool.

20:43.533 --> 20:45.035
-Mom, it wasn't me.
-I'm sorry.

20:45.118 --> 20:47.496
Are you okay, Ji-ho?

20:50.832 --> 20:51.667
Yeah.

20:52.542 --> 20:53.460
Thanks.

20:54.336 --> 20:56.296
All right.

20:59.591 --> 21:02.678
Chi-ho, do you mind if I take a call?

21:02.761 --> 21:04.721
Can't you see I'm playing a game?

21:04.805 --> 21:06.723
It's going to lag.

21:06.807 --> 21:07.641
It's my mom.

21:08.850 --> 21:09.977
Damn it.

21:10.477 --> 21:11.311
Answer, idiot.

21:15.190 --> 21:16.108
Hello?

21:16.191 --> 21:18.777
What the hell have you been up to?

21:20.487 --> 21:21.863
How much is all this?

21:21.947 --> 21:22.781
FOODMON ORDER HISTORY

21:22.864 --> 21:26.159
When I paid this off for you before,
I said that was the last time.

21:26.243 --> 21:28.495
How many times is this now?

21:28.578 --> 21:31.456
How am I supposed to make sense of this?

21:33.333 --> 21:37.587
Jang Seong-gu. Don't you have
anything to say to me? Well?

21:38.088 --> 21:39.881
Don't tell me it was your friend again.

21:39.965 --> 21:41.675
It really wasn't me.

21:41.758 --> 21:44.594
After all that humiliation last time,
you're lying again?

21:46.054 --> 21:49.558
Why are you growing up like this?
What's suddenly gotten into you?

21:51.727 --> 21:52.728
Seriously…

22:31.933 --> 22:35.812
Seong-gu wants to tell you everything
Lee Chi-ho has done to him.

22:37.064 --> 22:38.357
You'll tell him, right?

22:40.734 --> 22:41.568
Yes.

22:42.194 --> 22:43.945
I'll tell you everything.

22:45.030 --> 22:47.574
He says I can trust the ERPB.

22:55.582 --> 22:57.918
Do you think
the ERPB won't believe you either?

23:04.966 --> 23:07.386
If the ERPB had existed two years ago

23:08.345 --> 23:10.097
and had come

23:11.848 --> 23:12.974
to our school…

23:18.105 --> 23:20.690
I wouldn't have killed anyone…

23:22.859 --> 23:24.945
and no one would've died.

23:25.821 --> 23:28.073
Inspector Na Hwa-jin will be different.

23:29.741 --> 23:31.868
He's just like Ms. Choi.

23:38.041 --> 23:40.502
HE USED MY IDENTITY ON VARIOUS WEBSITES
TO SCAM PEOPLE

23:42.003 --> 23:43.046
Yes.

23:45.090 --> 23:46.091
Inspector.

23:46.591 --> 23:51.763
Well, did you hear about
the School Violence Committee meeting?

23:54.015 --> 23:58.979
Chi-ho reported Seong-gu for bullying.

24:00.147 --> 24:00.981
What?

24:08.405 --> 24:10.574
SCHOOL VIOLENCE DELIBERATION COMMITTEE

24:12.868 --> 24:15.704
VICTIM STUDENT

24:15.787 --> 24:18.915
ACCUSED STUDENT

24:23.086 --> 24:24.546
Just a moment.

24:25.255 --> 24:28.300
An ERPB inspector cannot legally serve
on the committee.

24:28.383 --> 24:29.384
Please have him leave.

24:29.468 --> 24:33.138
We also received a report
and have been monitoring the situation,

24:33.805 --> 24:36.224
so we need to understand what happened.

24:36.308 --> 24:38.101
I'll simply observe.

24:38.185 --> 24:39.436
Speaking is not permitted.

24:40.061 --> 24:40.896
Yes, sir.

24:41.897 --> 24:46.234
All right. We will now begin
the review of the school violence case

24:46.318 --> 24:47.652
at Jinwon High School.

24:47.736 --> 24:51.114
First, we will hear the statement
from the victim's side.

24:51.198 --> 24:53.617
Even before the incident
was fully investigated,

24:53.700 --> 24:56.870
Jang Seong-gu spread false rumors
about Lee Chi-ho

24:56.953 --> 25:00.874
and called in the ERPB,
effectively branding him as the bully.

25:00.957 --> 25:03.126
He is in severe psychological distress.

25:03.210 --> 25:06.796
His psychiatric treatment records
are hereby submitted as evidence.

25:11.760 --> 25:13.887
DEPRESSIVE DISORDER
PANIC DISORDER

25:14.721 --> 25:17.682
Next, we will hear from the accused.
Please make your statement.

25:22.187 --> 25:23.522
Oh, I…

25:31.238 --> 25:32.405
This isn't fair.

25:35.075 --> 25:37.786
I'm the victim here.

25:40.247 --> 25:43.083
They stole my accounts.

25:44.042 --> 25:46.545
They used them to run scams,

25:46.628 --> 25:47.712
play games,

25:48.588 --> 25:49.839
and order food.

25:49.923 --> 25:51.299
Is there any evidence?

25:53.176 --> 25:55.470
Do you have any evidence
that they stole your accounts?

25:56.471 --> 25:57.722
Well, that's--

25:57.806 --> 26:00.392
As you can see, his claim is one-sided
with no evidence.

26:01.059 --> 26:03.853
We cannot rule out
that he might be making false statements.

26:03.937 --> 26:06.523
If so, it could constitute defamation.

26:19.869 --> 26:22.372
You'll see if you look at the records.

26:22.455 --> 26:25.166
I'm online at an Internet café
while on an e-scooter

26:25.250 --> 26:27.836
and having food delivered elsewhere.
If you see the logs--

26:27.919 --> 26:29.045
That's right.

26:29.129 --> 26:32.507
Lee Chi-ho said he borrowed his accounts
a few times for urgent reasons.

26:32.591 --> 26:33.758
It wasn't a few times--

26:33.842 --> 26:35.218
Only answer

26:36.886 --> 26:38.096
what you're asked.

26:41.308 --> 26:44.436
Once or twice, Chi-ho borrowed
his streaming service account

26:44.519 --> 26:46.896
and used his account
to rent a bike a few times.

26:46.980 --> 26:48.189
That's all.

26:48.273 --> 26:53.278
And yet, Chi-ho wanted to help his friend
and sent Jang Seong-gu money.

26:53.361 --> 26:55.113
I never received any money.

26:55.196 --> 26:56.990
Please check your bank account.

27:04.164 --> 27:05.373
SEJIN TRANSACTION ACCOUNT

27:05.457 --> 27:07.709
LEE CHI-HO / REPAYMENT
DEPOSIT 1,000,000 WON

27:16.301 --> 27:17.385
By contrast,

27:17.469 --> 27:20.472
the harm Lee Chi-ho has suffered
is very serious.

27:20.555 --> 27:22.849
Deemed a bully, based on unfounded claims,

27:22.932 --> 27:24.893
he is being shunned
and isolated at school.

27:24.976 --> 27:27.646
But what's more concerning
is that this false narrative

27:27.729 --> 27:30.023
is even threatening Chi-ho's future.

27:30.106 --> 27:32.400
This is not simply defamation.

27:32.484 --> 27:34.235
It is social character assassination.

27:35.195 --> 27:38.323
Of course, we do not intend
to pursue criminal charges.

27:38.406 --> 27:41.076
However, we have submitted
the psychiatric records,

27:41.576 --> 27:43.787
and given his struggles
to keep up with studies,

27:43.870 --> 27:48.541
we believe an appropriate mediation,
compensation, or settlement is needed.

27:48.625 --> 27:50.085
A settlement?

27:51.670 --> 27:52.629
How much…

27:53.463 --> 27:57.342
That said,
since it's a matter between children,

27:57.425 --> 27:59.427
Chi-ho's mother, a truly admirable woman,

27:59.511 --> 28:03.098
wishes to receive an apology
and settle the matter here.

28:04.015 --> 28:06.267
What do you say, Seong-gu's mother?

28:14.818 --> 28:16.403
Chi-ho's mother.

28:17.987 --> 28:19.239
Thank you so much.

28:20.407 --> 28:22.742
I'll make sure this never happens again.

28:22.826 --> 28:25.912
I really appreciate your leniency.

28:26.413 --> 28:27.622
Chi-ho.

28:28.123 --> 28:29.749
I'm sorry, all right?

28:30.417 --> 28:32.043
I'm really sorry.

28:32.544 --> 28:33.586
My goodness, ma'am…

28:35.171 --> 28:36.423
So that's the situation.

28:37.465 --> 28:38.758
Understood, sir.

28:42.929 --> 28:44.264
Can you believe this?

28:44.764 --> 28:46.850
He did wrong,
yet he calls for the meeting.

28:46.933 --> 28:49.310
He even hired an expensive lawyer!

28:50.228 --> 28:55.150
These days, I hear lawyers specializing
in school bullying provide manuals.

28:56.025 --> 28:59.571
"File a complaint first.
That way, you can claim victim status."

28:59.654 --> 29:02.824
"File a counter-report.
That's how it turns into mutual fault."

29:02.907 --> 29:04.117
They say things like this.

29:04.200 --> 29:06.786
But still,
what's the School Violence Committee for?

29:07.287 --> 29:10.165
It should be able to determine the truth!

29:10.248 --> 29:13.168
But it's not that easy in reality.

29:13.251 --> 29:17.130
They have to review the case,
meet the students briefly,

29:17.213 --> 29:19.257
and reach a decision all on the same day.

29:19.340 --> 29:21.801
Since that's difficult,
they just look at the evidence,

29:21.885 --> 29:24.846
but they struggle
to decide who is at fault,

29:25.346 --> 29:28.600
handing down
similar rulings over and over.

29:28.683 --> 29:30.226
What should we do?

29:30.727 --> 29:32.479
Damn it, what are we going to do?

29:54.417 --> 29:56.336
SEONG-GU'S IPHONE

30:06.387 --> 30:08.014
SEONG-GU'S IPHONE, WEAK CONNECTION

30:17.273 --> 30:21.945
SEONG-GU'S IPHONE, STRONG CONNECTION

30:53.059 --> 30:54.310
There you are.

31:24.716 --> 31:26.885
It's okay to cry out loud, Seong-gu.

31:27.886 --> 31:29.387
Why are you holding it in?

31:34.976 --> 31:36.936
If you hold it in,

31:38.229 --> 31:39.814
no one will know you're crying.

31:42.275 --> 31:43.943
If you don't speak up,

31:44.736 --> 31:46.779
no one will know you've been wronged.

31:48.615 --> 31:52.660
And if you're curled up like this,
they'll never know what they did wrong.

31:59.292 --> 32:00.793
Is this how you want to live?

32:16.684 --> 32:18.686
All right, then.

32:30.740 --> 32:32.200
It's not fair!

32:32.784 --> 32:35.078
It's so unfair. It's driving me crazy.

32:42.418 --> 32:44.128
I told the police.

32:44.212 --> 32:47.256
I told my parents and my teachers.

32:47.757 --> 32:49.842
But no one believes me.

32:49.926 --> 32:53.846
I know they were being nice to me
just to use me.

32:53.930 --> 32:56.015
But they were all I had.

32:56.099 --> 32:59.435
They were my friends. They liked me.

33:02.063 --> 33:05.650
Chi-ho said he'd tell everyone everything.

33:06.150 --> 33:10.029
He said he'd come clean
about stealing my accounts.

33:10.113 --> 33:13.241
But he kept putting it off, playing dumb.

33:13.741 --> 33:15.952
And now he's saying I'm the bully.

33:16.786 --> 33:20.248
What if everyone thinks I lied?

33:21.582 --> 33:22.542
What do I do?

33:22.625 --> 33:25.503
Nobody believes me!

33:40.184 --> 33:41.853
Seong-gu, I believe you.

33:48.484 --> 33:50.028
I do believe you.

33:55.658 --> 33:57.702
So you should trust the ERPB too.

34:26.689 --> 34:27.523
Done.

34:29.108 --> 34:31.277
-Wait, what about the keychains?
-Oh!

34:32.028 --> 34:34.072
I have them. They're right here.

34:34.155 --> 34:35.281
Let's see.

34:36.824 --> 34:38.576
Do I have to put them all on?

34:38.659 --> 34:40.953
Just do as you're told, will you?

34:42.288 --> 34:43.289
Done.

34:45.458 --> 34:47.210
Oh, here they come.

34:47.293 --> 34:49.587
Damn it, there's no Wi-Fi.

34:49.670 --> 34:51.798
What do we do now? Our human Wi-Fi's gone.

34:52.298 --> 34:55.468
Don't worry.
We just need to find another Wi-Fi.

34:55.551 --> 34:57.136
You're so pretty!

34:57.887 --> 35:00.139
This was just lying next to you.

35:00.223 --> 35:02.391
I won't hurt your friends.

35:02.475 --> 35:03.476
-Hey, you dork.
-Why…

35:05.061 --> 35:06.062
Remember me?

35:09.690 --> 35:12.193
-Hi.
-Greeting a friend, are you?

35:12.276 --> 35:14.153
You need to act scared.

35:15.321 --> 35:16.239
Hi.

35:16.322 --> 35:17.698
You know you owe me, right?

35:17.782 --> 35:20.451
Oh, I'll pay you back
for your dry cleaning.

35:23.830 --> 35:26.249
No, it's okay. You can pay me back later.

35:27.125 --> 35:28.000
Are you new here?

35:28.668 --> 35:30.419
-Yeah.
-Oh, yeah?

35:30.503 --> 35:32.797
I'll show you around
since it's your first day.

35:32.880 --> 35:34.090
-Really?
-Yeah, let's go.

35:34.173 --> 35:36.300
-Thanks.
-You should lose this though.

35:36.384 --> 35:38.219
-Yeah.
-Why? Isn't it pretty?

35:43.641 --> 35:44.475
Hey.

35:46.102 --> 35:47.311
You're in my class?

35:48.646 --> 35:49.814
Right, yeah.

35:49.897 --> 35:51.107
Let's be friends.

35:52.817 --> 35:53.651
Thanks.

35:53.734 --> 35:55.027
No worries.

35:57.363 --> 35:58.281
-Hey.
-Stop.

35:58.990 --> 36:00.950
What kind of loser walks in front?

36:01.033 --> 36:02.201
Get behind them.

36:03.953 --> 36:05.580
Go ahead.

36:05.663 --> 36:06.914
Thanks.

36:14.422 --> 36:16.549
-Whoa, shit.
-Damn it.

36:16.632 --> 36:17.508
Hey, sorry.

36:17.592 --> 36:19.051
-You're an ass.
-You told me to.

36:19.135 --> 36:21.345
You must be nervous
because it's your first day.

36:21.429 --> 36:22.638
Are you okay there?

36:23.973 --> 36:25.016
You're fine.

36:28.394 --> 36:30.188
Inspector Im Han-rim, calm down.

36:30.271 --> 36:32.899
You're on a mission.
Keep your cool. Hold it together.

36:38.321 --> 36:39.155
I'm okay.

36:39.238 --> 36:40.865
Thanks for worrying about me.

36:41.699 --> 36:43.117
Yeah, sure.

36:43.201 --> 36:44.410
She fucking scared me.

36:44.493 --> 36:48.039
Hey, if you want to thank me,
can I use your Netflix account just once?

36:53.085 --> 36:56.339
These are my accounts
for Netflix, streaming, and games.

36:57.048 --> 36:59.300
I have LoL accounts for each tier.
Use whatever fits.

37:01.677 --> 37:03.554
You're prepared as fuck.

37:04.222 --> 37:06.265
Were you Wi-Fi at your old school?

37:06.349 --> 37:08.893
Oh, that's what you call it here.

37:09.393 --> 37:10.895
It was Hotspot at my old school.

37:10.978 --> 37:11.812
Hotspot?

37:12.313 --> 37:16.025
Also, if the Wi-Fi signal is weak,
let me know.

37:16.108 --> 37:19.612
I'll connect you to the router.
Here's the ID and password.

37:19.695 --> 37:21.489
Oh yeah, and…

37:21.989 --> 37:24.492
-Nice.
-Tell me if your battery's running low.

37:24.575 --> 37:25.868
Here's the charger.

37:25.952 --> 37:29.372
I also have cables
for every type of phone. I'll show you.

37:30.414 --> 37:33.376
There's a reason people prefer
experienced hires.

37:33.459 --> 37:35.169
You don't need to teach them.

37:35.253 --> 37:37.630
Hey, wow.

37:37.713 --> 37:40.508
Phones, please.
I'll fully charge them before class.

37:40.591 --> 37:41.926
Yeah, okay.

37:42.426 --> 37:44.095
Thanks. Here.

37:44.887 --> 37:45.846
Can you unlock these?

37:46.681 --> 37:47.515
Yeah, okay.

37:47.598 --> 37:49.642
-I'll connect them to the hotspot too.
-Okay.

37:49.725 --> 37:50.977
Thanks.

37:51.060 --> 37:53.312
Thanks.

37:53.396 --> 37:56.065
Wow, how did she get to tier 2?

37:56.148 --> 37:57.066
The mithril's mine.

37:57.149 --> 37:58.818
Did she buy the account? It's yours.

37:58.901 --> 38:01.404
I mean, how did she do it? How?

38:01.487 --> 38:03.864
She's better at PUBG than Jong-su.

38:04.448 --> 38:06.284
Damn, this is a bit intense.

38:06.367 --> 38:07.785
I'm taking the mithril.

38:14.583 --> 38:15.584
What the hell?

38:15.668 --> 38:17.545
Is some punk using my account?

38:18.296 --> 38:19.422
Check the login history.

38:20.381 --> 38:21.841
What the fuck? Colombia?

38:21.924 --> 38:23.884
Some ass in Colombia
logged into my account.

38:23.968 --> 38:25.136
You've been hacked.

38:25.219 --> 38:26.512
Fucking hell.

38:26.595 --> 38:28.306
He keeps trying to charge my account.

38:28.389 --> 38:30.057
He's fucked now. What's he gonna do?

38:30.141 --> 38:31.475
Fuck, I'm screwed.

38:31.559 --> 38:34.145
"Stop sending me stupid links, asshole."

38:34.228 --> 38:35.396
"Must be damn bored."

38:35.479 --> 38:37.315
"Spam is so freaking annoying."

38:37.398 --> 38:38.316
Use "hella."

38:38.399 --> 38:41.402
-"Hella" isn't used anymore, is it?
-Isn't it?

38:42.278 --> 38:43.446
What the fuck?

38:43.529 --> 38:44.864
My number is sending spam.

38:45.614 --> 38:46.741
MOM

38:46.824 --> 38:47.825
Mom, I didn't send it.

38:47.908 --> 38:49.035
What are you on about?

38:49.118 --> 38:50.578
Why would I send that to you?

38:50.661 --> 38:52.455
-I'll be ranking up.
-It wasn't me.

38:52.538 --> 38:54.457
Why won't you believe your own son?

38:56.500 --> 38:58.294
I've logged into Lee Chi-ho's account.

38:58.377 --> 39:01.505
This game has a very strict
profanity detection system.

39:01.589 --> 39:04.759
The suspension length depends
on how severe the language is.

39:04.842 --> 39:08.929
Im Han-rim, go all out with swearing
so he gets the longest ban possible.

39:11.390 --> 39:13.267
-Write this down.
-Hold on.

39:13.351 --> 39:15.394
You freaking son of a gun.
Buttfaced jerks.

39:15.478 --> 39:17.355
You Monday-morning assholes.

39:17.438 --> 39:21.484
If that's how your fucking brain works,
rip it out and hang it on a tree instead.

39:21.567 --> 39:22.526
You sons of bitches.

39:22.610 --> 39:24.487
Fuck, you really think you're hot?

39:24.570 --> 39:26.947
You're fucking ugly as hell, bastard.

39:27.031 --> 39:30.076
Keep fucking living like this,
and you're headed straight to hell.

39:30.159 --> 39:31.452
You fucking bastard!

39:31.535 --> 39:33.579
This is good. Keep going.

39:33.662 --> 39:36.040
I'll rip out your hair, eyes, tongue,

39:36.123 --> 39:39.126
cut your head off, and deep-fry them
in shit water, bastard.

39:39.210 --> 39:40.961
It'll taste fucking good, right?

39:41.045 --> 39:43.255
I'll chew you up real good
and pass you around

39:43.339 --> 39:45.174
so everyone gets a fucking bite.

39:45.257 --> 39:48.719
You motherfucker, I'll chew you up.
Sound yummy?

39:51.764 --> 39:53.265
What the fuck?

39:54.475 --> 39:57.269
Why does it say 300 years?

39:57.353 --> 39:58.979
What the actual fuck?

40:00.648 --> 40:01.774
2,500 WON CHARGED

40:01.857 --> 40:03.526
EXTRA 50 MINS
SURCHARGE: 10,000 WON

40:05.319 --> 40:06.153
Damn it.

40:07.196 --> 40:08.406
OUTSIDE SERVICE AREA: 22,000 WON

40:08.489 --> 40:09.532
Fucking hell.

40:09.615 --> 40:10.866
Fucking hell!

40:10.950 --> 40:12.326
This crazy bastard!

40:13.494 --> 40:14.328
Where you going?

40:14.829 --> 40:16.539
I'm going to kill this asshole.

40:19.834 --> 40:21.919
Fucking bastard. Can't be serious.

40:36.392 --> 40:38.227
Fucking hell.

40:38.727 --> 40:40.729
Goddamn it.

40:40.813 --> 40:42.606
For fuck's sake.

40:44.650 --> 40:45.651
Hey, there it is!

40:45.734 --> 40:47.027
-It's really here!
-Damn.

40:47.111 --> 40:49.155
It's really here. Check the plate.

40:50.156 --> 40:51.449
Hey, is it 8729?

40:51.532 --> 40:52.616
-What the hell?
-Yeah.

40:52.700 --> 40:53.951
-It's basically new.
-What?

40:54.034 --> 40:55.911
-Holy fuck!
-Hey!

40:57.329 --> 41:00.082
Who the hell are you?
What are you doing with my bike?

41:00.166 --> 41:01.500
Aren't you giving it away?

41:01.584 --> 41:03.335
Giving it away? What's this bullshit?

41:03.419 --> 41:04.712
Bullshit, my ass.

41:04.795 --> 41:06.130
Didn't you post this?

41:06.213 --> 41:08.799
What the hell? Who used my account to…

41:10.050 --> 41:12.344
That's not my problem.
I'll take good care of it.

41:12.428 --> 41:15.556
Fuck off! "I'll take good care of it"?
My ass. Get the hell out.

41:16.265 --> 41:17.808
-You fucking asshole.
-Wait.

41:18.309 --> 41:20.352
Wait a second. Listen.

41:20.436 --> 41:22.980
Some bastard must've hacked my account.

41:23.063 --> 41:24.982
Then bring that bastard here,

41:25.065 --> 41:28.277
or I'll beat the shit out of you,
fucking asshole.

41:31.280 --> 41:34.200
You fucking bitch. It was you, wasn't it?

41:34.700 --> 41:37.495
You asked me
to unlock my phone to hotspot.

41:38.662 --> 41:39.914
You messed with it, right?

41:41.207 --> 41:42.249
Let go of me and--

41:42.333 --> 41:44.627
Fuck you.
Come clean while I'm still being nice.

41:46.545 --> 41:48.297
Let go while I'm still being nice.

41:48.380 --> 41:49.507
What?

41:57.223 --> 41:58.766
Fucking hell.

42:00.309 --> 42:01.602
Yeah, it was me.

42:01.685 --> 42:03.187
Are you out of your mind?

42:03.270 --> 42:05.564
Do you know how much shit
you've fucking caused me?

42:07.358 --> 42:09.151
How much?

42:09.693 --> 42:13.489
Was it so bad you'd rather die
than come to school?

42:16.200 --> 42:17.910
You're not there yet, are you?

42:17.993 --> 42:19.703
You fucking…

42:26.502 --> 42:30.130
-Fucking hell.
-Wait! Wait a…

42:30.923 --> 42:32.049
Wait a second.

42:32.132 --> 42:35.094
My throat's a bit sore.

42:38.389 --> 42:41.016
Help me! Save me!

42:41.517 --> 42:42.685
-Lee Chi-ho.
-What is it?

42:42.768 --> 42:44.311
-What are you doing?
-I'm sorry.

42:44.979 --> 42:46.105
-What is it?
-Help me.

42:47.898 --> 42:48.857
What are you doing?

42:49.441 --> 42:50.359
Hey.

42:50.442 --> 42:52.152
It's not what you think.

42:52.236 --> 42:54.530
Something about that jerk
always seemed off.

42:54.613 --> 42:56.490
Here comes the School Violence Committee.

43:00.452 --> 43:01.704
I didn't do anything.

43:01.787 --> 43:02.621
She's a nutjob.

43:02.705 --> 43:04.498
I'm telling you, she's a nutjob.

43:04.582 --> 43:06.333
-Help me.
-Seriously?

43:06.417 --> 43:07.751
Help me.

43:08.919 --> 43:11.255
Chi-ho is not the bully.

43:11.338 --> 43:12.965
He's actually the victim.

43:13.048 --> 43:15.509
The transfer student
hacked into his phone,

43:15.593 --> 43:16.969
got his game account banned,

43:17.052 --> 43:20.973
and even committed fraud
by posting fake sales on resale apps.

43:21.056 --> 43:23.559
Do you have any evidence
to support this claim?

43:23.642 --> 43:26.312
Why should I have to prove it
when I'm the victim?

43:26.395 --> 43:28.314
Ask the transfer student.

43:28.397 --> 43:29.690
Excuse me.

43:42.077 --> 43:44.788
We're sorry for being late.

43:45.998 --> 43:46.957
She needed treatment.

43:47.041 --> 43:48.792
VICTIM STUDENT

43:50.294 --> 43:51.837
And I'm here

43:51.920 --> 43:55.257
on behalf of the victim's lawyer
because something came up.

43:55.341 --> 43:56.592
You're not even a lawyer.

43:56.675 --> 43:58.719
What gives you
the right to appear on his behalf?

43:58.802 --> 44:00.220
I have power of attorney.

44:03.807 --> 44:05.142
-Here's the document.
-Okay.

44:05.225 --> 44:07.603
Which lawyer wrote
that ridiculous power of attorney?

44:07.686 --> 44:10.064
-I know most of the lawyers.
-It's this man here.

44:10.564 --> 44:11.732
Do you know him?

44:13.692 --> 44:17.571
-It's Choi Gang-seok.
-Minister Choi also has a law license.

44:17.655 --> 44:19.907
He's a member of the Bar Association

44:19.990 --> 44:22.451
and served
on the Legislation and Judicial Committee.

44:22.534 --> 44:25.579
Even so, the ERPB's intervention
in the School Violence Committee

44:25.663 --> 44:26.914
is an abuse of power.

44:27.831 --> 44:29.708
What you're being handed right now

44:30.376 --> 44:31.543
is an official notice

44:31.627 --> 44:34.922
stating that this committee
will fall under the ERPB's supervision.

44:35.005 --> 44:36.131
Please take a look.

44:36.674 --> 44:39.760
Okay, then. We will begin
the School Violence Committee hearing.

44:40.469 --> 44:41.387
Thank you.

44:41.470 --> 44:44.932
Lee Chi-ho terrorized Im Han-rim so much

44:45.015 --> 44:49.269
that she's in a terrible state.

44:49.353 --> 44:51.772
Oh no, look at you drooling.

44:51.855 --> 44:54.942
She was branded an outcast
as soon as she transferred,

44:55.025 --> 44:57.945
and the happy school life she deserved
became utter hell.

44:58.028 --> 45:00.197
It's okay. Let's try to start over, okay?

45:00.280 --> 45:03.534
She's been left with lifelong trauma
and even mental health issues.

45:03.617 --> 45:05.160
Seriously? Come on!

45:05.244 --> 45:07.079
She's putting on a show!

45:07.162 --> 45:10.290
-I'm the one who got messed with and hit.
-Don't listen.

45:11.250 --> 45:12.084
All right?

45:13.210 --> 45:14.545
Chi-ho.

45:15.504 --> 45:16.880
I'm telling you, she's acting!

45:16.964 --> 45:19.258
What's wrong with you?
Sit down. I'm sorry.

45:19.341 --> 45:20.759
-Chi-ho!
-Oh my! What are you…

45:20.843 --> 45:22.428
-See? Look at him.
-Hey.

45:22.511 --> 45:25.431
I know you're fine. You're not even sick.

45:26.390 --> 45:28.308
-Look at him.
-Tell them.

45:28.392 --> 45:30.018
Tell them it's all a lie, an act.

45:30.102 --> 45:31.895
Like my son says, if it's an act…

45:35.107 --> 45:37.317
Stop it! Oh my goodness.

45:39.236 --> 45:40.654
How does it feel?

45:42.322 --> 45:44.283
Are you finally asking yourself,

45:44.867 --> 45:45.993
"Why did I do that?"

45:49.413 --> 45:51.623
Will it only sink in
if your finger gets broken?

45:51.707 --> 45:53.208
Oh my God, what's wrong with her?

45:53.292 --> 45:55.085
All right, Inspector Im Han-rim.

45:56.545 --> 45:57.504
Oh no, my son.

45:59.423 --> 46:01.884
Inspector Im Han-rim here

46:02.384 --> 46:05.721
is actually an ERPB field investigator
who was assigned

46:05.804 --> 46:08.307
to look into the bullying case
involving Jang Seong-gu.

46:08.932 --> 46:11.226
Right, so that's what's been going on.

46:12.394 --> 46:14.938
So why did we go to such lengths?

46:15.439 --> 46:18.734
It's because of Jang Seong-gu.

46:22.946 --> 46:24.281
Seong-gu!

46:25.866 --> 46:26.867
You see us, right?

46:39.213 --> 46:40.088
Yes.

46:40.714 --> 46:44.426
We are here to clear his name.

46:46.386 --> 46:47.596
How does it feel?

46:48.889 --> 46:51.850
Do you finally realize

46:52.392 --> 46:53.644
what you did to Seong-gu?

46:53.727 --> 46:56.104
This is really not fair.

46:57.564 --> 46:59.483
I never even laid a finger on Seong-gu.

46:59.566 --> 47:01.860
That's right. You never hit him.

47:02.486 --> 47:05.531
There's not a scratch on him.
But do you think it wasn't violence?

47:06.949 --> 47:09.368
You never touched him,

47:10.577 --> 47:12.788
yet he was scared, terrified,

47:12.871 --> 47:15.082
wronged, and frustrated.

47:15.582 --> 47:18.210
No one believed him,
no matter what he said.

47:18.710 --> 47:20.879
Not even his parents. That's right.

47:21.630 --> 47:24.049
He probably thought
it'd be better to be beaten.

47:24.132 --> 47:24.967
Why?

47:25.467 --> 47:27.427
Because if he had marks from it,

47:29.179 --> 47:31.098
his parents might believe him.

47:32.474 --> 47:34.142
Do you know what's worse?

47:34.685 --> 47:37.020
To get out of the situation,

47:37.104 --> 47:40.858
he had no choice but to beg
the very person who put him there.

47:40.941 --> 47:43.777
The victim had no choice
but to bow his head…

47:46.613 --> 47:48.866
and plead with the bully.

47:50.409 --> 47:52.202
This is what you did to Seong-gu.

47:52.995 --> 47:54.580
Without laying a finger on him.

48:02.921 --> 48:04.464
It's been hard for you, hasn't it?

48:05.048 --> 48:08.010
It must've been so hard, all on your own.

48:08.510 --> 48:10.804
Seong-gu, I'm sorry. All right?

48:11.305 --> 48:15.017
I was such a fool.

48:15.100 --> 48:17.811
I should've believed you.

48:21.481 --> 48:23.233
Our investigation found

48:23.817 --> 48:27.738
that Lee Chi-ho's testimony
about suffering harm

48:28.322 --> 48:30.824
because of Jang Seong-gu was false

48:30.908 --> 48:33.577
and that the actual victim
is Jang Seong-gu.

48:33.660 --> 48:35.704
Accordingly, the ERPB will implement

48:35.787 --> 48:39.291
appropriate protective measures
for the victim, Jang Seong-gu, at once.

48:39.374 --> 48:43.295
Additionally, the prior ruling against him
by the School Violence Committee

48:44.087 --> 48:48.008
will be fully nullified
by the authority of the ERPB.

48:51.011 --> 48:52.846
A victim is a victim.

48:53.555 --> 48:54.973
A bully is a bully.

48:57.351 --> 48:59.353
Is that so difficult?

49:06.193 --> 49:08.278
Adults should protect children.

49:10.072 --> 49:12.074
Aren't you ashamed to face them?

49:33.887 --> 49:36.098
Thank you for helping me.

49:36.181 --> 49:38.100
You'll be issued a new resident number.

49:38.684 --> 49:39.893
Do well at school.

49:39.977 --> 49:41.603
Thank you, sir.

49:41.687 --> 49:43.438
Thank you so much.

49:43.522 --> 49:44.690
It's finally over, ma'am.

49:44.773 --> 49:47.901
I'll make sure to raise Seong-gu well.

49:48.902 --> 49:50.320
Go home with your mother.

49:50.404 --> 49:51.238
Okay.

49:58.328 --> 49:59.162
Your friend?

49:59.746 --> 50:00.914
Well.

50:14.136 --> 50:15.137
I'm sorry.

50:15.721 --> 50:17.431
You told me not to do anything.

50:19.516 --> 50:20.475
But still,

50:20.559 --> 50:23.895
something good happened
because I did what I could.

50:25.063 --> 50:26.273
I'm glad.

50:48.295 --> 50:49.755
Welcome.

51:04.186 --> 51:05.896
Get your own glass.

51:06.396 --> 51:08.648
That's for Ga-yun.

51:39.888 --> 51:41.056
Lie down here.

51:42.265 --> 51:43.308
Careful.

52:03.662 --> 52:04.788
Hey.

52:06.790 --> 52:08.458
You should find another woman.

52:09.417 --> 52:10.252
Goodness.

52:11.962 --> 52:14.464
Ga-yun would be mad at me, you know?

52:15.507 --> 52:17.259
Imagine if she heard that.

52:19.094 --> 52:22.097
She'd go on at you
for a couple of hours at least.

52:22.722 --> 52:23.807
You know.

52:29.855 --> 52:30.772
God.

52:47.664 --> 52:49.249
Busted.

52:52.169 --> 52:53.086
No way.

52:57.507 --> 52:59.050
Fine, I won't smoke.

53:28.622 --> 53:29.623
Here.

53:30.373 --> 53:31.208
Cheers!

53:32.125 --> 53:34.711
Why would I toast with this guy?

53:35.795 --> 53:38.465
I don't toast with someone
who doesn't like me either.

53:43.220 --> 53:45.472
Are you really going to be like this?

53:45.555 --> 53:46.598
Yeah, I am.

53:46.681 --> 53:47.974
He leaves me no choice.

53:50.518 --> 53:51.353
Fine, then.

53:52.812 --> 53:53.772
I won't get married.

53:55.232 --> 53:56.900
Where'd that come from?

53:57.567 --> 53:58.401
Good.

53:58.485 --> 54:00.946
Yeah. But I'll never get married.

54:02.197 --> 54:04.074
-Never?
-Yeah.

54:04.658 --> 54:06.284
If I can't marry Hwa-jin,

54:06.368 --> 54:08.328
I'll just live alone
till I get old and die.

54:08.912 --> 54:12.123
Then, Dad, you'll never get to hold
your grandchild

54:12.207 --> 54:15.752
or hear them call you "Grandpa."
You'll just grow old.

54:16.253 --> 54:20.465
If you don't want that,
should you be acting like this or not?

54:21.049 --> 54:22.801
Well, that can't happen.

54:24.636 --> 54:28.181
Then do you think
you two should be toasting or not?

54:30.433 --> 54:31.268
Shall we?

54:32.227 --> 54:33.687
Make it a couples' shot.

54:33.770 --> 54:35.480
That's gross. Why would we do that?

54:35.563 --> 54:38.024
Then I won't get married.
Whatever. I'm recording.

54:38.108 --> 54:39.150
-Ga-yun, that's…
-Wait.

54:39.234 --> 54:40.360
-One…
-Hold on. Hey.

54:40.443 --> 54:41.278
Two…

54:41.361 --> 54:42.654
Three!

56:12.327 --> 56:13.953
For fuck's sake.

56:14.537 --> 56:15.372
Hey.

56:16.122 --> 56:16.956
Damn it.

56:18.583 --> 56:20.377
You said I'd win.

56:20.460 --> 56:22.545
You said if I got a lawyer,
it'd be game over.

56:27.467 --> 56:28.968
File a report first.

56:29.469 --> 56:30.720
Why should I?

56:31.221 --> 56:32.055
What for?

56:32.138 --> 56:35.225
I don't think you can afford
to be this relaxed right now.

56:35.934 --> 56:40.772
The ERPB will do everything they can
to brand you as the bully.

56:41.272 --> 56:42.941
Then you'll at least get suspended.

56:43.024 --> 56:43.942
No,

56:44.818 --> 56:46.027
you may even get expelled.

56:50.281 --> 56:52.200
You need to lay the groundwork first.

56:53.118 --> 56:55.703
The first one to file
becomes the victim in today's world.

56:56.871 --> 57:00.333
If you don't want to be branded
as the bully, act like the victim.

57:01.584 --> 57:03.002
This person will help you.

57:03.503 --> 57:04.921
ATTORNEY YOON TAE-GYEONG

57:06.005 --> 57:07.424
Now what?

57:08.716 --> 57:12.095
-I think everything went as planned.
-Fucking hell.

57:12.595 --> 57:15.265
What the fuck are you talking about?

57:17.183 --> 57:19.769
Hey, my life's over because of the ERPB.

57:20.937 --> 57:22.981
It's over for my family because of me.

57:23.064 --> 57:25.733
I feel like I have to fucking die
to end this.

57:27.610 --> 57:29.946
So how can you say it went as planned?
You bastard.

57:31.281 --> 57:33.783
I reported you to the ERPB
for bullying Jang Seong-gu

57:34.451 --> 57:36.161
so they would come after you.

57:37.745 --> 57:39.247
Do you know what happens next?

57:40.582 --> 57:41.416
This.

57:52.927 --> 57:55.680
MIRAE DAEHAN PARTY

57:55.763 --> 57:57.182
Sir.

58:00.059 --> 58:01.227
Have you seen this?

58:01.728 --> 58:03.605
The ERPB is in serious trouble.

58:03.688 --> 58:06.816
Something happened
while they were at Jinwon High.

58:11.362 --> 58:13.198
Sir, you have a visitor.

58:13.281 --> 58:14.115
Let them in.

58:15.200 --> 58:16.034
Well.

58:17.452 --> 58:19.746
What brings you here at this hour?

58:21.915 --> 58:22.749
Have a seat.

58:22.832 --> 58:23.666
Okay.

58:23.750 --> 58:26.085
Please bring us some tea.

58:27.086 --> 58:27.921
Sure.

58:28.963 --> 58:33.551
Wait, shouldn't you be on your way
to school right now?

58:33.635 --> 58:35.512
I have something to give you.

58:35.595 --> 58:37.597
I'll be on my way after I give you this.

58:37.680 --> 58:40.016
I can't miss school.

58:43.186 --> 58:45.104
My life's over because of the ERPB.

58:45.730 --> 58:47.440
It's over for my family because of me.

58:47.524 --> 58:50.360
I feel like I have to fucking die
to end this.

58:52.695 --> 58:54.864
What is this?

58:55.949 --> 58:56.950
It's what you wanted.

58:59.953 --> 59:01.287
Oh, it's okay.

59:01.371 --> 59:02.997
There were no cameras.

59:07.335 --> 59:08.962
It's not that I don't trust you.

59:10.296 --> 59:12.924
You can decide how you want to use it.

59:21.891 --> 59:24.561
STUDENT FALLS FROM JINWON HIGH ROOFTOP
SUICIDE SUSPECTED

59:25.979 --> 59:26.813
Hey.

59:28.481 --> 59:30.775
What the hell did you do?

59:31.442 --> 59:33.528
You think I got you out
so you could do this?

59:34.988 --> 59:35.989
Oh.

59:37.115 --> 59:38.199
That's not it.

59:40.785 --> 59:42.912
You didn't get me out.

59:44.247 --> 59:46.124
I planned all of this.

59:49.877 --> 59:50.712
What?

59:50.795 --> 59:52.964
You didn't drag me into this.

59:53.047 --> 59:55.258
I dragged you into it.

59:55.967 --> 59:58.678
I sent Officer Kang to you.

01:00:17.155 --> 01:00:18.239
PAROLE REVIEW MATERIALS

01:00:20.033 --> 01:00:22.535
DEEMED SUITABLE FOR SOCIAL REINTEGRATION
THROUGH PAROLE

01:00:26.539 --> 01:00:31.169
It really helped that you pulled strings
with the parole board.

01:00:31.669 --> 01:00:32.503
Thank you.

01:00:34.047 --> 01:00:35.048
You little shit!

01:00:37.717 --> 01:00:38.801
Now, don't swear.

01:00:39.719 --> 01:00:42.597
If you want to be president,
you should keep your dignity.

01:00:44.807 --> 01:00:47.060
At the end of the day,
you and I are the same.

01:00:47.727 --> 01:00:50.104
We both want to bring down the ERPB.

01:01:23.596 --> 01:01:26.516
Minister, how is Lee Chi-ho doing
right now?

01:01:26.599 --> 01:01:28.643
-Have you seen him?
-It's Hwang Gi-tae.

01:01:28.726 --> 01:01:30.228
Are you here to see Lee Chi-ho?

01:01:30.311 --> 01:01:34.023
How do you respond to another incident
like this happening at Jinwon High?

01:01:34.107 --> 01:01:35.441
What's going on?

01:01:36.150 --> 01:01:38.528
Mr. Hwang, what brings you here?

01:01:38.611 --> 01:01:41.030
The entire country is in uproar
over this tragedy.

01:01:41.114 --> 01:01:42.198
How could I not come?

01:01:44.325 --> 01:01:46.119
For now, his treatment is the priority.

01:01:46.619 --> 01:01:47.453
You should leave.

01:01:47.537 --> 01:01:50.832
I don't think you're in a position
to be saying that.

01:01:58.881 --> 01:02:00.633
My life's over because of the ERPB.

01:02:01.426 --> 01:02:03.428
It's over for my family because of me.

01:02:03.511 --> 01:02:06.305
I feel like I have to fucking die
to end this.

01:02:09.016 --> 01:02:10.977
Do you honestly believe

01:02:11.477 --> 01:02:14.188
the ERPB played no part
in what happened to Lee Chi-ho?

01:02:17.608 --> 01:02:20.987
The release of an audio clip
of a Jinwon High School student

01:02:21.070 --> 01:02:23.781
who allegedly attempted suicide
has shocked the public.

01:02:23.865 --> 01:02:28.202
The five-second clip
that is going viral on social media

01:02:28.286 --> 01:02:32.665
features the student's own voice
expressing resentment toward the ERPB.

01:02:32.749 --> 01:02:34.959
The police are focusing
their investigation

01:02:35.042 --> 01:02:38.045
on the clip's authenticity,
who recorded it,

01:02:38.129 --> 01:02:39.630
and how it was distributed.

01:02:40.131 --> 01:02:42.550
The political sphere
is also taking immediate action,

01:02:42.633 --> 01:02:45.428
calling for an urgent inquiry to determine

01:02:45.511 --> 01:02:47.638
whether there were
any unlawful acts or coercion

01:02:47.722 --> 01:02:49.682
during the ERPB's investigation.

01:02:49.766 --> 01:02:50.933
JINWON HIGH SCHOOL

01:04:52.305 --> 01:04:55.266
Subtitle translation by: Lisa Kim
